DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T160000
UID:69f10e432866a5b4884b6a56@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us the last Wednesday of every month for our monthly
  movie matinee. May's film is\nNomadland\n.\nA woman in her sixties\, afte
 r losing everything in the Great Recession\, embarks on a journey through 
 the American West\, living as a van-dwelling modern-day nomad.\nStarring: 
 Frances McDormand. Directed by Chloé Zhao.\nRated: R. Length:1h 47m.\n*Su
 btitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available
