BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Drawing with Wacom Tablets
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T163000
UID:69eb8269c1cf6f9a7587739c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore the fundamentals of digital illustration using a Wacom
  Tablet\, a popular tool for artists and designers. In this hands-on class
 \, you will learn (i) how to set up and navigate the Wacom tablet and pen 
 settings (ii) practice basic drawing techniques including line work\, shad
 ing\, and pressure sensitivity. Create your very own bookmark using layer
 s\, brushes\, and color palettes.\nPlease arrive\n5-10 minutes\nbefore the
  program or your spot may be forfeited.
LOCATION:Albion\, Digital Innovation Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69eb8269c1cf6f9a7587739c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
