BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LSP: Conversation with Ontario Health Coalition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T120000
UID:69e8e49d1e64afd01e6aead8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:What is Healthcare Privatization and How it Impacts Everyday P
 atients?\n(Free Workshop\, Mandarin only)\nBring your concerns and questio
 ns to this urgent conversation with Ontario Health Coalition.\n• What is
  public healthcare privatization? Where are they in the community?\n• Wh
 at is the relationship between wait times and privatization\, or the two-t
 ier healthcare\nsystem?\n• Do I need to pay out of my pocket when I visi
 t a private clinic?\n• Will private clinics supplement the public hospit
 al’s capacity?\n• Will private clinics save taxpayer money and improve
  access?\n• Is private care better or more efficient than public service
 s?\n*Ontario Health Coalition is a non-profit\, non-partisan\, patients’
  rights advocacy organization.\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees
