 ooks in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nMay Book Title:\nThe Personal L
 ibrarian\nby Marie Benedict\nJune Book Title:\nHome\n: A Memoir of My Ear
 ly Years by Julie Andrews\nTo get a copy of the book\, please visit the 1
