BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STEMoirs: A Biography Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T200000
UID:695db58b2c65973d00165efe@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover and discuss memoirs\, and biographies written about 
 significant contributors to STEM (science\, technology\, engineering\, and
  math). No scientific background required. Upcoming titles TBD.
