DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T160000
UID:69d572e8129f127438372774@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore the incredible resources and expertise offered by ACCE
 S Employment. Connect with an Employment Consultant to get tailored resume
  reviews\, invaluable interview tips\, and a wealth of additional support.
 \nBook a\nfree 30-minute appointment\nand embark on a remarkable journey t
 oward your dream job.\nRegistration is required\n. Limited spots are avail
 able. Appointments are limited to one per person.\nREGISTER HERE.\nConsult
 ant #1\nConsultations will take place in the Business\, Science and Techno
 logy Department (\n4th Floor\n). For questions\, email\nclbst@tpl.ca\nor c
 all the North York Central Library\, Business\, Science and Technology Dep
 artment at\n416-395-5613\n.\nIf no slots are available on your desired con
 sultation date\, contact ACCES Employment directly for an appointment at\n
 416-443-9008\n(North York Location) /\n416-921-1800\n(Downtown Location). 
 Or visit\naccesemployment.ca
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, 4th Floor. Business\, Science\, and 
