SUMMARY:Author Talk with Rachel Phan
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T200000
UID:69e93cb01e64afd01e6b0592@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Bloor/Gladstone Library is hosting Rachel Phan\, author of
  bestseller and Canada Reads 2026 Longlist\nRestaurant Kid\n\, for an inti
 mate conversation about growing up as the daughter of Chinese-Vietnamese r
 efugees\, navigating the pressures of cultural expectations\, and writing 
 through the complexities of identity\, community\, and care.\nThis reading
  and conversation will invite reflection on community\, culture\, and comi
 ng of age in a colonial society.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e93cb01e64afd01e6b0592
