 month. Dive into a great read\, share your thoughts\, and enjoy lively dis
 cussions. Whether you're a bookworm or just looking for a fun way to explo
 re new genres\, all are welcome!\nThis month we'll be reading:\nAll Fours 
 by Miranda July\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the
