DESCRIPTION:Come join us the last Wednesday of every month for our monthly
  movie matinee. June's film is\nMissing\n.\nWhen her mother disappears whi
 le on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend\, June's search for answ
 ers is hindered by international red tape. However\, as she digs deeper\, 
